# Section design system

Source of truth: `client/src/lib/section-design-system.js` + `client/src/app/section-theme.css`.

## Token layers

| Token | Light band | Dark band | Light-card preset | Glass-card preset |
|-------|------------|-----------|-------------------|-------------------|
| `--band-bg` | `#fff` | `var(--ink)` | (inherits band) | (inherits band) |
| `--band-fg` | `var(--ink)` | `#fff` | — | — |
| `--card-bg` | `--ds-light-card-bg` | `--ds-glass-card-bg` | **always** `--ds-light-card-bg` | `--ds-glass-card-bg` |
| `--field-bg` | light fields | glass fields | **always** light fields | glass fields |

Fixed palettes (`--ds-light-*`, `--ds-glass-*`) are declared on `:root` and applied via `data-section-theme` or surface presets — **never** hardcode `bg-white` / `dark:bg-slate-*` on cards.

## Components

- `SectionSurface` — only place that sets band background (`section-band-bg` + `data-section-theme`).
- `SectionBand` — transparent section root.
- `SectionLightCard` — white card on any band (forms, team, trust badges).
- `SectionMediaOverlay` — light text on photos.

## Classes

- `DS_TEXT.heading|muted|subtle|placeholder|eyebrow`
- `DS_FIELD.input|label`
- `DS_CARD.ui` → `section-ui-card` (+ Tailwind `border`, radius, padding)
- `DS_CARD.chip` → `section-ui-chip`

## Do not

- `bg-white` / `dark:bg-slate-*` on cards (use `section-ui-card` + surface preset).
- `text-slate-*` / `text-ink` / `text-white` for band copy (use `DS_TEXT.*`).
- Opaque `bg-white` on the outer `<section>` of a CMS placement.
